sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React api.js
  participant MW as Guard JWT
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as Model
  participant DB as MySQL

  U->>FE: aksi UI submit / buka halaman
  FE->>MW: fetch /api/mp/... + cookie
  MW->>MW: baca JWT httpOnly
  alt belum login / token rusak
    MW-->>FE: 401
    FE-->>U: Alert + arahkan login
  else role/syarat tidak cukup
    MW-->>FE: 403
    FE-->>U: halaman verifikasi / dilarang
  else lolos
    MW->>C: req.user terisi
    C->>C: validasi body
    C->>M: query parameterized
    M->>DB: SELECT / INSERT / UPDATE
    DB-->>M: rows
    M-->>C: objek domain
    C-->>FE: JSON ok true
    FE-->>U: render hasil
  end
